{
  "$schema": "https://xnsteam-ai.github.io/Html-library/r/schema.json",
  "name": "section-faq",
  "title": "FAQ",
  "description": "A five-question accordion built on native details/summary, with a rotating plus icon and a contact line.",
  "category": "sites",
  "type": "html",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "tailwind": "^4.0.0",
  "tags": [
    "faq",
    "accordion",
    "support"
  ],
  "surface": "section",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "section-faq.html",
      "type": "html",
      "content": "\n<!--\n  FAQ Section — a real accordion built on <details>/<summary>.\n  Each entry opens and closes natively; the chevron rotates via `group-open:`.\n-->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-white px-6 py-24 dark:bg-neutral-950\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\">\n    <div class=\"text-center\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-[36px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">\n        Frequently asked questions\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n        Can't find it here? <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-gray-100\">Ask the team</a>.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-12 divide-y divide-gray-200 border-y border-gray-200 dark:divide-white/10 dark:border-white/10\">\n      <details open class=\"group/faq\">\n        <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">\n          <span class=\"text-[16px] font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Can I migrate an existing pipeline?</span>\n          <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 transition group-open/faq:rotate-45 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-gray-400\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </summary>\n        <p class=\"pb-5 pr-11 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n          Yes. Point us at the repository and we read your existing config, then show a dry run of\n          what would change before anything is applied.\n        </p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"group/faq\">\n        <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">\n          <span class=\"text-[16px] font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">What counts as a build minute?</span>\n          <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 transition group-open/faq:rotate-45 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-gray-400\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </summary>\n        <p class=\"pb-5 pr-11 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n          Wall-clock time a runner spends executing your build command. Queue time and cache\n          restoration are not billed.\n        </p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"group/faq\">\n        <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">\n          <span class=\"text-[16px] font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Do preview URLs expire?</span>\n          <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 transition group-open/faq:rotate-45 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-gray-400\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </summary>\n        <p class=\"pb-5 pr-11 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n          They live as long as the pull request does, then are removed on merge or close. Pinning a\n          preview keeps it indefinitely.\n        </p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"group/faq\">\n        <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">\n          <span class=\"text-[16px] font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Is there a self-hosted option?</span>\n          <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 transition group-open/faq:rotate-45 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-gray-400\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </summary>\n        <p class=\"pb-5 pr-11 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n          On the Enterprise plan you can run the build agents inside your own network while the\n          control plane stays managed.\n        </p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"group/faq\">\n        <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">\n          <span class=\"text-[16px] font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">How do I cancel?</span>\n          <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 transition group-open/faq:rotate-45 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-gray-400\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </summary>\n        <p class=\"pb-5 pr-11 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n          From billing settings, in one click. Your projects keep serving until the end of the\n          period you already paid for.\n        </p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n"
    }
  ]
}
